kerId":3005501,"speakerName":"？？？","textMapHash":943510650,"text":"旅人さん、こんにちは！最近どうですか？「南十字」武装船隊を手伝ってみませんか？","nextNodeIds":[726520102,726520103]},{"nodeId":726520102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2264753290,"text":"「南十字」武装船隊…？","nextNodeIds":[726520104]},{"nodeId":726520104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3005501,"speakerName":"？？？","textMapHash":2735474338,"text":"ええと…アハハ、すみませんね！","nextNodeIds":[726520105]},{"nodeId":726520105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":901061186,"text":"「死兆星」号の首席機関士、慕珍と言う者です。ずっと船倉にいてあまり出てこなかったから、知らないのもおかしくありません。","nextNodeIds":[726520106]},{"nodeId":726520106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2831034154,"text":"その結果、海龍さんに追い出されちゃいました、ハハ。","nextNodeIds":[726520107]},{"nodeId":726520107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2877079714,"text":"「体を動かせ！たまには日光を浴びろ！」って、私を海岸に降ろしました…","nextNodeIds":[726520108]},{"nodeId":726520108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1118744154,"text":"なのに、自分は船から降りることすらできません。陸地酔いするから。","nextNodeIds":[726520109,726520110]},{"nodeId":726520109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3670004010,"text":"そうか…","nextNodeIds":[726520111]},{"nodeId":726520111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1432826,"text":"あ、本当にごめんなさい。人のことを笑うばかりで、大事なことを忘れてしまいました。","nextNodeIds":[726520112]},{"nodeId":726520112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1227344858,"text":"北斗の姉御の次の航路に備えて準備をしなくちゃいけないから、雑用の手助けをして欲しいのです。","nextNodeIds":[726520113]},{"nodeId":726520113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":3764707058,"text":"以前は、こう言ったことも姉御が自らやっていました。「南十字」を統べる者、先駆者となって危険に踏み込まなければ…","nextNodeIds":[726520114]},{"nodeId":726520114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1218731906,"text":"これも私たち「南十字」の掟です。誰が親玉になろうと、この危険を担う義務があります。","nextNodeIds":[726520115]},{"nodeId":726520115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":379021690,"text":"今は姉御が稲妻で優先すべき注文があるから、こんなことで邪魔しちゃいけません。","nextNodeIds":[726520116]},{"nodeId":726520116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1321584530,"text":"だからオイラたちに押し付けるのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[726520117]},{"nodeId":726520117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2713793810,"text":"エヘッ、私は機関士だから戦うのはちょっと…船のみんなも自分の仕事があって、忙しんですよ。","nextNodeIds":[726520118]},{"nodeId":726520118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2347005378,"text":"雑談はここまでにして、事情を言いますと——","nextNodeIds":[726520119]},{"nodeId":726520119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":589932858,"text":"次の注文の雇い主がサンプルを要求してきたんです。つまり、この地で見られる特殊な遺跡機械の部品です。","nextNodeIds":[726520120]},{"nodeId":726520120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1002387698,"text":"雇い主が渡してくれた目撃情報によると、あの機械…あるいは生物は稲妻列島に隠れていて、非常に面白いと。","nextNodeIds":[726520121,726520125,726520130]},{"nodeId":726520121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2790452594,"text":"雇い主…？","nextNodeIds":[726520122]},{"nodeId":726520122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":3521160826,"text":"どうしました、「南十字」の秘密を聞きたいのですか？","nextNodeIds":[726520123]},{"nodeId":726520123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":4024029178,"text":"ハハ、緊張しないでください。私も知っていたら、教えてあげたいところなんですが…こっちの世界で、「死罪」で罰されますからね。","nextNodeIds":[726520124]},{"nodeId":726520124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2436754218,"text":"だからすみません。雇い主が誰なのかは知らないんです。あなたにとっても重要なことではないでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[726520134]},{"nodeId":726520134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4237457850,"text":"居場所はどこ？","nextNodeIds":[726520135]},{"nodeId":726520135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1107356850,"text":"良い質問です。","nextNodeIds":[726520136]},{"nodeId":726520136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":361086906,"text":"今、居場所が分からなくて悩んでました。","nextNodeIds":[726520137]},{"nodeId":726520137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2828405418,"text":"しかし、島のいくつかのところで怪しい雷元素の活動を確認しました。私の推測によると、その頻度は他の雷元素の活動と大きく差があって…","nextNodeIds":[726520138]},{"nodeId":726520138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1218171466,"text":"まとめて言いますと、それらの異常が発生したエリアを先に調査すれば、私たちの目標へと導いてくれる可能性が高いです。","nextNodeIds":[726520139]},{"nodeId":726520139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1922475698,"text":"ついでに、もしあの機械たちから副産物が出たら、それも私に持ってきて欲しいのです。","nextNodeIds":[726520140]},{"nodeId":726520140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2362733426,"text":"ご安心ください、報酬はきちんと払います。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726520125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1562610066,"text":"機械生物…？","nextNodeIds":[726520126]},{"nodeId":726520126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":1123355674,"text":"…はい、以前、層岩巨淵でも似たような機械が掘り出されました、500年前の厄災と関係あるんだとか。","nextNodeIds":[726520127]},{"nodeId":726520127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":276012946,"text":"とにかく…遺跡をぐるぐる回っている不吉な存在なんですが、恐ろしいばかりじゃなく、ドキドキも止まりません…","nextNodeIds":[726520128]},{"nodeId":726520128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2782640018,"text":"ここにもいると知ったら、1体分解したくてたまらなくなって…","nextNodeIds":[726520129]},{"nodeId":726520129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":2832823874,"text":"機関士じゃないあなたには理解し難いですね。","nextNodeIds":[726520134]},{"nodeId":726520130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2894306378,"text":"面白い…？","nextNodeIds":[726520131]},{"nodeId":726520131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":133707266,"text":"うん…自分の手で分解したくなりませんか？","nextNodeIds":[726520132]},{"nodeId":726520132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4011626146,"text":"あまり…したくはないな。","nextNodeIds":[726520133]},{"nodeId":726520133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30055,"speakerName":"慕珍","textMapHash":4257042882,"text":"はぁ。いいでしょう…機関士だけが、私の熱情が分かるのです。","nextNodeIds":[726520134]},{"nodeId":726520110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":577984386,"text":"何かお困り？","nextNodeIds":[726520111]},{"nodeId":726520103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3435112562,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}の知り合い？","nextNodeIds":[726520104]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7265201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3005501"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7265202,"order":2,"stepDescription":"雷元素の異常地点へ向かい挑戦をクリアする","stepDescTextMapHash":3413126484,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"1332200531"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_G